# ESP-NOW encryption keys (Module 14, Practice 8): never pushed to GitHub. The example is keys.example.h.
keys.h
# Module 21: broker password file (MQTT account fingerprints): never pushed to GitHub. The ACL list edge/acl-broker may be committed.
edge/broker-passwd
# Module 26: the Docker Compose settings hold ALL your home's secrets (.env at the root for compose.cloud.yml, edge/.env for
# the Pi gateway; this line applies in any folder) and their copies. Only the example (.env.example) may go in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Module 26: the gateway -> center bridge copy (edge/bridge/center.conf) holds the pi-bridge account's password
edge/bridge/*.conf
# Module 26: database and Grafana cupboard backups (pg_dump, tar): large, and they hold personal data
backup/
